    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d800">

                <pb facs="0768" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg668"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/7879: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Commissioner at
                        Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-07T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 7,
                                1921—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>1. Disregard Department’s 106, December 30, 1 p.m.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d800-f1"
                    /></p>
                <p>Force Commander European waters, London, has instructions to keep vessel within
                    easy sailing distance.</p>
                <p>Keep Department and also Embassy London fully informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
